<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 192,244.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 192,244.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 9 totaled 192,244 bales compared with 191,806 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 798 bales issued, 985 bales awaiting review, 360 cancellation, and 9,416 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
